# PC card team-concord (TMODE-33 CONCORD, BENCH-150): arm bb (A/A, master again), all 46 teams, 12 seeds from 6700, against master (the aa build). Template: ccprep writes work/team-concord-bb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
12
--seed-base
6700
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
team-census46.txt
